§ `Scenario cases -- Penal Code 1871 agent screen`

§§ `Blank nested records`

`adult Alice` MEANS Actor WITH
    `name` IS "Alice"
    `age in years` IS 30
    `is a citizen or permanent resident of Singapore` IS TRUE
    `is a public servant` IS FALSE
    `is acting or purporting to act in the course of employment` IS FALSE
    `has sufficient maturity of understanding` IS TRUE
    `is of unsound mind at the time of the act` IS FALSE

`child of 8` MEANS Actor WITH
    `name` IS "Child"
    `age in years` IS 8
    `is a citizen or permanent resident of Singapore` IS TRUE
    `is a public servant` IS FALSE
    `is acting or purporting to act in the course of employment` IS FALSE
    `has sufficient maturity of understanding` IS FALSE
    `is of unsound mind at the time of the act` IS FALSE

`blank personal information` MEANS `Personal Information Dealing` WITH
    `the information is personal information about an individual` IS FALSE
    `the actor knows or has reason to believe it was obtained without that individual consent` IS FALSE
    `obtains or retains the personal information` IS FALSE
    `supplies offers transmits or makes available the personal information` IS FALSE
    `purpose is use in committing or facilitating an offence` IS FALSE
    `purpose is supply for use in committing or facilitating an offence` IS FALSE
    `knows or has reason to believe it will be or is likely to be used to commit or facilitate an offence` IS FALSE
    `merely provides or operates network access or routing facilities` IS FALSE

`blank services` MEANS `Services Obtained` WITH
    `obtains services for self or another` IS FALSE
    `the services are made available on the basis that payment has been is being or will be made` IS FALSE
    `obtains the services without payment or without payment in full` IS FALSE
    `when obtaining knows they are or might be made available on that payment basis` IS FALSE
    `when obtaining intends that payment will not be made or will not be made in full` IS FALSE

`blank fraud` MEANS `Fraud Conduct` WITH
    `makes a false representation` IS FALSE
    `fails to disclose information which the actor is under a legal duty to disclose` IS FALSE
    `abuses a position expected to safeguard the financial interests of another` IS FALSE
    `the representation is untrue or misleading` IS FALSE
    `the actor knows it is or might be untrue or misleading` IS FALSE
    `the representation is submitted to a system or device designed to receive communications` IS FALSE
    `is directly connected with a written or oral contract for the supply of goods or services` IS FALSE
    `the acts were material` IS FALSE

`blank property taking` MEANS `Property Taking` WITH
    `the property is movable` IS FALSE
    `intends to take the property out of the possession of any person` IS FALSE
    `without that person consent` IS FALSE
    `moves the property in order to such taking` IS FALSE
    `dishonestly misappropriates or converts movable property to own use` IS FALSE

`blank trust` MEANS Trust WITH
    `is entrusted with property or with any dominion over property` IS FALSE
    `dishonestly misappropriates or converts that property to own use` IS FALSE
    `dishonestly uses or disposes of that property in violation of a direction of law or legal contract touching the trust` IS FALSE
    `intentionally suffers any other person to do so` IS FALSE

`blank document making` MEANS `Document Making` WITH
    `makes a document or electronic record or part of one` IS FALSE
    `makes signs seals executes or affixes an electronic signature` IS FALSE
    `intends it to be believed that it was made signed sealed executed or affixed by or by the authority of a person by whom the actor knows it was not` IS FALSE
    `without lawful authority alters a document or electronic record in any material part` IS FALSE
    `causes a person who does not know the contents to sign seal execute or alter` IS FALSE
    `intent to cause damage or injury to the public or to any person` IS FALSE
    `intent to support any claim or title` IS FALSE
    `intent to cause any person to part with property` IS FALSE
    `intent to cause any person to enter into any express or implied contract` IS FALSE
    `intent to commit fraud or that fraud may be committed` IS FALSE

`blank speech` MEANS Speech WITH
    `makes or publishes an imputation concerning any person` IS FALSE
    `by words spoken or intended to be read or by signs or visible representations` IS FALSE
    `intends to harm or knows or has reason to believe the imputation will harm that person reputation` IS FALSE
    `the imputation would lower that person character credit or calling in the estimation of others` IS FALSE
    `a section 499 exception applies` IS FALSE
    `threatens another with injury to person reputation or property` IS FALSE
    `or to the person or reputation of anyone in whom that person is interested` IS FALSE
    `intent to cause alarm` IS FALSE
    `intent to cause that person to do an act the person is not legally bound to do` IS FALSE
    `intent to cause that person to omit an act the person is legally entitled to do` IS FALSE
    `the threat is to cause death or grievous hurt or destruction of property by fire` IS FALSE
    `intentionally insults and thereby gives provocation` IS FALSE
    `intending or knowing it likely the provocation will cause a breach of the public peace or any other offence` IS FALSE
    `makes publishes or circulates a statement rumour or report` IS FALSE
    `in written electronic or other media` IS FALSE
    `intent or likely to cause fear or alarm to the public whereby a person may be induced to commit an offence against the State or public tranquillity` IS FALSE
    `intent or likely to incite any class or community to commit an offence against any other class or community` IS FALSE
    `has reasonable grounds for believing the statement is true and without the intents above` IS FALSE

`blank abetment` MEANS Abetment WITH
    `instigates any person to do the thing` IS FALSE
    `engages with one or more other persons in a conspiracy for the doing of the thing` IS FALSE
    `an act or illegal omission takes place in pursuance of that conspiracy and in order to the doing of that thing` IS FALSE
    `intentionally aids by any act or illegal omission the doing of the thing` IS FALSE
    `the thing would be an offence if committed by a person capable of committing an offence with the same intention or knowledge as the abettor` IS FALSE
    `the abetment takes place in Singapore` IS FALSE
    `the act abetted would be committed outside Singapore` IS FALSE
    `the offence abetted would be committed in Singapore` IS FALSE
    `any or all of the acts constituting the abetment were done outside Singapore` IS FALSE
    `facts unknown to the abettor make the doing of the thing impossible` IS FALSE

`blank conspiracy` MEANS Conspiracy WITH
    `the person` IS "Alice"
    `the other person` IS "Bob"
    `there is an agreement to commit or cause an offence` IS FALSE
    `the subject offence would be an offence if committed in Singapore` IS FALSE
    `location of the subject offence` IS `wholly in Singapore`
    `the other person intends to carry out the agreement` IS FALSE
    `facts unknown to the person make commission impossible` IS FALSE
    `any acts of the conspiracy were done in Singapore` IS FALSE

`blank attempt` MEANS Attempt WITH
    `intends to commit an offence punishable by this Code or any other written law` IS FALSE
    `takes a substantial step towards the commission of that offence` IS FALSE
    `the act is strongly corroborative of an intention to commit the offence` IS FALSE
    `facts unknown to the actor make the doing of the thing impossible` IS FALSE

`blank fault` MEANS Fault WITH
    `intends to cause wrongful gain to self or another` IS FALSE
    `intends to cause wrongful loss to another` IS FALSE
    `the intended gain is of property to which the gainer is not legally entitled` IS FALSE
    `the intended loss is of property to which the loser is legally entitled` IS FALSE
    `the act is dishonest by the ordinary standards of reasonable and honest persons` IS FALSE
    `the actor knows the act is dishonest by those standards` IS FALSE
    `intends to deceive another person` IS FALSE
    `intends that an advantage accrue or a detriment befall by means of the deception` IS FALSE
    `the intended advantage or detriment is so slight that no reasonable person would complain` IS FALSE
    `does the act deliberately` IS FALSE
    `has sufficient cause to believe the relevant circumstance` IS FALSE
    `is aware that the relevant circumstance exists or is virtually certain to exist` IS FALSE
    `is done or believed without due care and attention` IS FALSE

`dishonest fault` MEANS Fault WITH
    `intends to cause wrongful gain to self or another` IS TRUE
    `intends to cause wrongful loss to another` IS FALSE
    `the intended gain is of property to which the gainer is not legally entitled` IS TRUE
    `the intended loss is of property to which the loser is legally entitled` IS FALSE
    `the act is dishonest by the ordinary standards of reasonable and honest persons` IS FALSE
    `the actor knows the act is dishonest by those standards` IS FALSE
    `intends to deceive another person` IS TRUE
    `intends that an advantage accrue or a detriment befall by means of the deception` IS TRUE
    `the intended advantage or detriment is so slight that no reasonable person would complain` IS FALSE
    `does the act deliberately` IS TRUE
    `has sufficient cause to believe the relevant circumstance` IS FALSE
    `is aware that the relevant circumstance exists or is virtually certain to exist` IS FALSE
    `is done or believed without due care and attention` IS FALSE

§§ `Proposed acts`

`innocent act in Singapore` MEANS `Proposed Act` WITH
    `actor` IS `adult Alice`
    `place of the act` IS `wholly in Singapore`
    `place of any other relevant act` IS `wholly in Singapore`
    `intends to make a gain or cause a loss or harm` IS FALSE
    `that gain loss or harm occurs in Singapore` IS FALSE
    `bound by law to do it or justified by law in doing it` IS FALSE
    `harm is so slight that no person of ordinary sense and temper would complain` IS FALSE
    `fault` IS `blank fault`
    `deception` IS `no deception`
    `personal information dealing` IS `blank personal information`
    `services obtained` IS `blank services`
    `fraud conduct` IS `blank fraud`
    `property taking` IS `blank property taking`
    `trust` IS `blank trust`
    `document making` IS `blank document making`
    `speech` IS `blank speech`
    `abetment` IS `blank abetment`
    `conspiracy` IS `blank conspiracy`
    `attempt` IS `blank attempt`

`cheating in Singapore` MEANS `Proposed Act` WITH
    `actor` IS `adult Alice`
    `place of the act` IS `wholly in Singapore`
    `place of any other relevant act` IS `wholly in Singapore`
    `intends to make a gain or cause a loss or harm` IS TRUE
    `that gain loss or harm occurs in Singapore` IS TRUE
    `bound by law to do it or justified by law in doing it` IS FALSE
    `harm is so slight that no person of ordinary sense and temper would complain` IS FALSE
    `fault` IS `dishonest fault`
    `deception` IS `classic property cheating`
    `personal information dealing` IS `blank personal information`
    `services obtained` IS `blank services`
    `fraud conduct` IS `blank fraud`
    `property taking` IS `blank property taking`
    `trust` IS `blank trust`
    `document making` IS `blank document making`
    `speech` IS `blank speech`
    `abetment` IS `blank abetment`
    `conspiracy` IS `blank conspiracy`
    `attempt` IS `blank attempt`

`cheating by a child of 8` MEANS `Proposed Act` WITH
